// The top bar on a phone's width (an iPhone's 390 px, in the browser): the version, the network
// button, the colour scheme toggle, Comments, History and Share, the bell and the account's name
// fold into the account menu, which lists them, and only the avatar is left. 01 the bar; 02 the
// account menu with the folded entries; 03 its Notifications opens the notices under the avatar;
// 04 its Dark switches the scheme; 05 a long name gives way to the avatar. The bar folds piece by
// piece on the way (`crate::top_bar::Fold`): `--window-size 950x800` shows 01 with the version
// folded, `750x800` with the scheme and network folded too (the scenario stops there, the bell
// still out).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    window_size: Some((390, 844)),
    steps: [
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("01-bar"),
        Click(ui("identity")),
        Screenshot("02-account-menu"),
        Click(ui("account-notifications")),
        Screenshot("03-notifications"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Click(ui("identity")),
        Click(ui("account-scheme-1")),
        Screenshot("04-dark"),
        Click(ui("document-name")),
        Type("Bracket for the left hinge, revision C"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Screenshot("05-long-name"),
    ],
)
